# Local Supabase data backups (production data dumps — keep local, never commit)
backups/

# Generated dead-link reports (scripts/flag-dead-links.ts) — keep local
reports/*

# ...except the known-gaps register. It is a durable editorial record, not a
# generated report: it says which topics were searched for and found to have no
# published UK guidance. Gitignored it would be lost on a fresh clone, which
# would defeat the point of keeping a register at all.
!reports/known-gaps.md

# Generated provider-sync staging output (scripts/sync-providers.ts) — regenerated
# each run and uploaded as a CI artifact, so it is never committed.
candidates.json

# Transient baseline extracted from git history by scripts/tests/equivalence.test.ts.
# Deleted by the test in a finally; listed here as a safety net if the process dies.
scripts/.equivalence-baseline.ts
